    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"feature\">The [[lookup @name lowercase]] moves up to its Speed without provoking &amp;Reference[OpportunityAttacks]. Each [[lookup @target.affects.type activity=fKlN5QustrK7LaSG]] within [[lookup @target.template.size activity=fKlN5QustrK7LaSG]] feet of the [[lookup @name lowercase]] as it moves is targeted once by the following effect.</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Strength Saving Throw</em>: DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=fKlN5QustrK7LaSG]].</p><p class=\"feature\"><em>Failure:</em> [[/damage average]] damage, and the target has the &amp;Reference[Restrained apply=false] condition until the end of its next turn.</p>",
